---
title: "forceLogoutAll (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_fetch_active: RPC get_currently_in_user_ids()
    q_fetch_active --> q_rpc_error: RPC call fails
    q_rpc_error --> [*]: return success=false, DB error message
    q_fetch_active --> q_check_count: usersToLogOut retrieved
    q_check_count --> q_no_active: usersToLogOut.length = 0
    q_no_active --> q_log_empty: INSERT daily_logout_logs(affected_count=0, status=success)
    q_log_empty --> [*]: return success=true, "no active users"
    q_check_count --> q_build_records: usersToLogOut.length > 0
    q_build_records --> q_insert_logout: build attendanceRecords with type='out' for each user
    q_insert_logout --> q_insert_fail: INSERT INTO attendance.attendances fails
    q_insert_fail --> q_log_error: INSERT daily_logout_logs(affected_count=0, status=error)
    q_log_error --> [*]: return success=false, error message
    q_insert_logout --> q_insert_success: INSERT succeeds
    q_insert_success --> q_log_success: INSERT daily_logout_logs(affected_count=N, status=success)
    q_log_success --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath(/admin, /dashboard/teams)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success=true, count=N

    note right of q_build_records
        INV-001: all currently 'in' users receive an 'out' record
        INV-002: operation is logged in daily_logout_logs regardless of outcome
        INV-003: batch insert - all or nothing for the attendance records
    end note
